cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "XAIServe: an explainable AI platform for gut-microbiome disease prediction"
abstract: >-
  XAIServe predicts disease from gut-microbiome relative abundances and explains
  each prediction with SHAP. Models and their explainers are logged to MLflow as
  one artifact, served by a framework-agnostic inference service, and published
  from a web interface that draws interactive SHAP charts.
type: software
